---
import { ENYA_URL } from "@/lib/constants";
---

<section class="room-hero">
  <img
    class="room-hero__plate"
    src="/images/room/volcano-hero.jpg"
    alt="Lorenzo de Leo alone on the Volcano Innovation Summit stage, with his name and Managing Director, ENYA Ventures on the screen behind him."
    width="1616"
    height="1080"
    loading="eager"
    fetchpriority="high"
    decoding="async"
  />
  <div class="room-hero__scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="room-hero__copy">
    <p class="room-kicker">Managing Director, ENYA Ventures</p>
    <h1 class="text-d1">
      Adding AI to your company is an upgrade.
      <span class="hero-break">Being AI‑native is a redesign.</span>
    </h1>
    <p class="room-hero__lede">
      For leadership teams, family businesses, founders, and investors.
      English, Spanish, or Italian.
    </p>
    <p class="room-hero__who">
      I'm Lorenzo de Leo, Managing Director of
      <a href={ENYA_URL} class="enya-mark" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ENYA Ventures</a>,
      a Miami pre-seed fund that backs AI‑native founders in Latin America.
      I invest in this thesis, and I'm building the fund to run on it.
      Research, meeting prep, and relationship memory already do.
    </p>
    <p class="room-hero__credit">Volcano Innovation Summit, 2026 · Photo: Volcano Summit</p>
  </div>
</section>
